      &lt;a href=&quot;/es/audience/proyect-managers&quot; typeof=&quot;skos:Concept&quot; property=&quot;rdfs:label skos:prefLabel&quot;&gt;Project managers&lt;/a&gt;    &lt;/li&gt;
      &lt;li&gt;
      &lt;a href=&quot;/es/audiencia/site-builder&quot; typeof=&quot;skos:Concept&quot; property=&quot;rdfs:label skos:prefLabel&quot;&gt;Site Builder&lt;/a&gt;    &lt;/li&gt;
  
&lt;/ul&gt;
  &lt;span class=&quot;field-label&quot;&gt;
    Presenters:
  &lt;/span&gt;

&lt;ul class=&quot;field-session-presenter inline&quot;&gt;

      &lt;li&gt;
      &lt;a href=&quot;/es/asistentes/e0ipso&quot;&gt;e0ipso&lt;/a&gt;    &lt;/li&gt;
  
&lt;/ul&gt;

  &lt;div class=&quot;field-body&quot;&gt;
    &lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Workbench is a suite of Drupal modules that provides authors, editors, and publishers with a unified interface for managing content relevant to them. Used by organizations of all shapes and sizes, Workbench is a solution that allows people to focus on their content, rather than on learning Drupal.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This session will focus on how to get Workbench working, what can it do &quot;out of the box&quot; and how we can alter the default settings to serve our purposes. All seen from a live demo.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At the end of the session some guidelines will be given to developers to develop modules that integrate to the suite.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is the same session I presented at &lt;a href=&quot;http://barcelona2012.drupaldays.org/sessions/content-moderation-workflow-workbench&quot;&gt;Drupal Developer Days 2012&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;iframe src=&quot;http://player.vimeo.com/video/61255408&quot; width=&quot;500&quot; height=&quot;281&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; webkitallowfullscreen=&quot;&quot; mozallowfullscreen=&quot;&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://vimeo.com/61255408&quot;&gt;Content moderation workflow with Workbench( incluídas preguntas) - Mateu Aguiló Bosch&lt;/a&gt; from &lt;a href=&quot;http://vimeo.com/drupales&quot;&gt;Asociación Drupal&lt;/a&gt; on &lt;a href=&quot;http://vimeo.com&quot;&gt;Vimeo&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
