 <title>Automating Drupal Development with Patterns</title>
 <link>http://2012.drupalcamp.es/es/sesiones/automating-drupal-development-patterns-38</link>
 <description>  &lt;span class=&quot;field-label&quot;&gt;
    Audience:
  &lt;/span&gt;

